      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### What did you know about your dataset?"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "H0kj-8xxnORC"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The dataset I worked with was a labeled collection of brain MRI images specifically curated for tumor classification. It was structured into three main folders — `train/`, `valid/`, and `test/` — each containing four subfolders, one for each class:\n",
        "\n",
        "**Glioma Tumor**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Meningioma Tumor**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Pituitary Tumor**\n",
        "\n",
        "**No Tumor**\n",
        "\n",
        "Each subfolder held actual MRI scan images belonging to that class. Along with these images, there were also _classes.csv files in each folder mapping the image filenames to their corresponding labels. This made it easier to validate if the directory structure was correctly mapped and helpful during evaluation."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "gfoNAAC-nUe_"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## ***2. ML Model Implementation***"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "VfCC591jGiD4"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### 1. Custom CNN Model"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OB4l2ZhMeS1U"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Preproccesing of Image\n",
        "\n",
        "#Image & Batch Size\n",
        "\n",
        "IMG_SIZE = (224,224)\n",
        "BATCH_SIZE = 32\n",
        "\n",
        "#Training data w/ Augmentation\n",
        "\n",
        "train_datagen = ImageDataGenerator(\n",
        "    rescale=1./255,\n",
        "    rotation_range = 20,\n",
        "    zoom_range = 0.2,\n",
        "    horizontal_flip = True,\n",
        "    width_shift_range = 0.1,\n",
        "    height_shift_range = 0.1\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "#Testing Data w/o Augmentation\n",
        "test_val_datagen = ImageDataGenerator(rescale=1./255)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "RlpZXQytWgBl"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#Preparing Data Generators\n",
        "\n",
        "# Update path if needed\n",
        "train_dir = os.path.join(data_dir, 'train')\n",
        "valid_dir = os.path.join(data_dir, 'valid')\n",
        "test_dir = os.path.join(data_dir, 'test')\n",
        "\n",
        "train_generator = train_datagen.flow_from_directory(\n",
        "    train_dir,\n",
        "    target_size=IMG_SIZE,\n",
        "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
        "    class_mode='categorical'\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "valid_generator = test_val_datagen.flow_from_directory(\n",
        "    valid_dir,\n",
        "    target_size=IMG_SIZE,\n",
        "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
        "    class_mode='categorical'\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "test_generator = test_val_datagen.flow_from_directory(\n",
        "    test_dir,\n",
        "    target_size=IMG_SIZE,\n",
        "    batch_size=BATCH_SIZE,\n",
        "    class_mode='categorical',\n",
        "    shuffle=False\n",
        ")\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7ebyywQieS1U",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "outputId": "159faa57-e7ff-4e54-a063-d7109c8486e7"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Found 1695 images belonging to 4 classes.\n",
            "Found 502 images belonging to 4 classes.\n",
            "Found 246 images belonging to 4 classes.\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#Building of CNN Model\n",
        "\n",
        "model = Sequential([\n",
        "    Conv2D(32, (3,3), activation='relu', input_shape=(224,224,3)),\n",
        "    BatchNormalization(),\n",
        "    MaxPooling2D(2,2),\n",
        "\n",
        "    Conv2D(64, (3,3), activation='relu'),\n",
        "    BatchNormalization(),\n",
        "    MaxPooling2D(2,2),\n",
        "\n",
        "    Conv2D(128, (3,3), activation='relu'),\n",
        "    BatchNormalization(),\n",
        "    MaxPooling2D(2,2),\n",
        "\n",
        "    Flatten(),\n",
        "    Dense(128, activation='relu'),\n",
        "    Dropout(0.5),\n",
        "    Dense(4, activation='softmax')  # 4 classes: glioma, meningioma, pituitary, no tumor\n",
        "])\n",
        "\n",
        "model.compile(optimizer=Adam(learning_rate=0.0001),\n",
        "              loss='categorical_crossentropy',\n",
        "              metrics=['accuracy'])\n",
        "\n",
        "early_stop = EarlyStopping(monitor='val_loss', patience=5, restore_best_weights=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "checkpoint = ModelCheckpoint(\"best_cnn_model.h5\",\n",
        "                             monitor='val_accuracy',\n",
        "                             save_best_only=True,\n",
        "                             mode='max',\n",
        "                             verbose=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "#Training the Model\n",
        "\n",
        "history = model.fit(\n",
        "    train_generator,\n",
        "    validation_data=valid_generator,\n",
        "    epochs=25,\n",
        "    callbacks=[early_stop, checkpoint]\n",
        ")\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
