        "The final model was trained using EfficientNetB0, a more advanced and efficient pre-trained architecture. Similar to the MobileNetV2 setup, I froze the base layers of EfficientNetB0 and added custom dense layers for classification. The model was compiled with the Adam optimizer and trained using early stopping to prevent overfitting. I used the same image size and batch configuration to keep the comparisons fair and consistent across all models.\n",
