        "From the three models I trained which were Custom CNN, MobileNetV2, and EfficientNetB0. I chose the MobileNetV2 model for my final deployment.\n",
        "\n",
        "The main reason I selected EfficientNetB0 is because it gave the highest test accuracy of ( 89.84% ), which was better than both the CNN ( 82.11% ) and MobileNetV2 ( 86.18% ). It also showed smooth and stable training without overfitting, and the accuracy/loss graphs confirmed that it was learning well.\n",
        "\n",
        "Apart from performance, EfficientNetB0 is also lightweight and fast, which makes it ideal for real-time prediction in a web app like Streamlit. It gave me the perfect balance between speed and accuracy, which is why I used it for my final model.\n",
        "\n"
